# {{.DisplayName}} — Veilbox desktop configuration

Owned by the veilbox-experience-{{.Name}} package. Read-only; the
Desktop Engine reads these templates and renders user-side
configuration (never overwriting what already exists).

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| niri.config.kdl | Niri compositor configuration template (terminal, editor, keybindings, Noctalia integration) |
| noctalia.config.toml | Noctalia user config template — includes the Veilbox-managed file below |
| noctalia-veilbox.toml | Veilbox-owned Noctalia settings (theme, bar, wallpaper) |
| wallpaper.png | Veilbox default wallpaper |

Package installation and desktop activation are separate
responsibilities: installing this RPM never changes the systemd
default target and never enables services. Activate with
'veil desktop install {{.Name}}'; regenerate Veilbox-owned settings
with 'veil desktop provision {{.Name}}'.
